        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908060/extras/7eec5b0319f4a0e83c762e69aee7a437.avif?t=1762957788\" width=1536 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You return to the decaying home of your grandfather. Dust covers the furniture, the lights flicker, and something stares from the end of the hall.<br>Something is watching. Something is remembering.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908060/extras/98f72f91e918d244a949928569822d37.poster.avif?t=1762957788\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908060/extras/98f72f91e918d244a949928569822d37.webm?t=1762957788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908060/extras/98f72f91e918d244a949928569822d37.mp4?t=1762957788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908060/extras/8ca0a7e83e95941849cb138d4918d333.avif?t=1762957788\" width=1536 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The curse of your family will take you to places worse than hell. Will you survive?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908060/extras/b0150ed78f415934da6b231dfa7fb8c6.poster.avif?t=1762957788\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908060/extras/b0150ed78f415934da6b231dfa7fb8c6.webm?t=1762957788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908060/extras/b0150ed78f415934da6b231dfa7fb8c6.mp4?t=1762957788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908060/extras/78385350ed1f3ec6fa3097814beae672.avif?t=1762957788\" width=1536 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From old notes to hidden codes, each clue brings you closer to unlocking the secrets buried inside the house.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908060/extras/47ccb2a35953d55b0356782e81562280.poster.avif?t=1762957788\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908060/extras/47ccb2a35953d55b0356782e81562280.webm?t=1762957788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908060/extras/47ccb2a35953d55b0356782e81562280.mp4?t=1762957788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908060/extras/13d72ed496c241abefe21339735a990f.avif?t=1762957788\" width=1536 height=300 /></span><strong>Behind the haunting atmosphere lies a deep, emotional story. Uncover hidden memories, family secrets, and a truth that connects past and present.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
